  <ul>
    <li><a href={conceptHref("transport")}>The transport</a>: how refs and objects move between repositories.</li>
    <li>The <a href={docHref("packages/vcs-commands/README.md")}>vcs-commands reference</a>: branches, checkout, merge, rebase, cherry-pick.</li>
    <li>The <a href={docHref("packages/vcs-core/README.md")}>vcs-core reference</a>: refs, batches and reflogs in detail.</li>
  </ul>
</Docs>
